<title>POLAND: KPBP-Bick Q2 net flat at PLN 0.8 mln.</title>
<headline>KPBP-Bick Q2 net flat at PLN 0.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>KPBP-Bick preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.15   vs    0.92</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.29   vs    1.22</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.78   vs    0.79</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: KPBP-Bick SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     26.50   vs   18.85</p>
<p>    costs of sales			23.64   vs   16.72</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.06   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.50   vs    0.43</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  11.76   vs    0.50</p>
<p>    financial costs		     11.57   vs    0.16</p>
<p>    investment			     0.22   vs    0.67</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.33   vs    1.40</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.89   vs    1.93</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.25   vs    1.16</p>
<p>    net sales			     43.43   vs   33.22</p>
<p>    costs of sales			38.76   vs   29.31</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.06   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.65   vs    0.77</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  18.88   vs    0.81</p>
<p>    financial costs		     18.25   vs    0.24</p>
<p>    investment			     0.30   vs    1.65</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
